  m_text: 'You are Defeated if you can no longer continue the battle.

    + During
    the Discard Phase, if the total value of cards in your Hand is less than the
    Boss''s ATK, you lose.

    + During the Player Turn, if you have no cards left
    in your Hand, you lose.

    + If you need to draw a card but the Deck is empty,
    you lose.'
