  m_text: "If you defeat the boss without using a trait, you will receive an additional
    reward:\r\n\t1. If you still have cards in hand, you will draw 2 cards at the
    start of your turn against the next boss.\r\n\t2. If you have no cards in hand,
    you will draw 2 cards at the start of your turn against the next boss."
